	(descr "Unified push-push microSD: SHOU HAN TF PUSH (LCSC C393941, 2x Ø0.80 pegs @ 8.00mm) + GCT MEM2075-00-140-01-A (2x Ø0.75 pegs @ 6.80mm). Locating holes are slots sized to accept EITHER part's pegs (union + clearance). Contacts identical 1.10mm pitch. Pinout matches Hirose DM3AT: 1-8 signals, 9=shield/GND. Dwgs.User rect = GCT MEM2075 body keepout (keep top Cu/vias out only if the GCT part will be fitted; not required for TF PUSH). Verify seating against an actual socket before assembly.")
